#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:4
msgid "Импорт из Jira и GitLab"
msgstr "Import from Jira and GitLab"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:6
msgid ""
"URI, параметры, входные и выходные данные и YAML-примеры каждого компонента "
"приведены в :ref:`справочнике конечных точек <camel_external_endpoints>`."
msgstr ""
"Each component's URI, parameters, input and output data, and YAML examples "
"are provided in the :ref:`endpoint reference <camel_external_endpoints>`."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:9
msgid "GitLab"
msgstr "GitLab"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:11
msgid ""
":ref:`gitlab-commits-sync <GitLabCommitsSyncEndpoint>` выдаёт пачки "
"коммитов."
msgstr ""
":ref:`gitlab-commits-sync <GitLabCommitsSyncEndpoint>` produces batches of "
"commits."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:12
msgid ""
":ref:`gitlab-merge-requests-sync <GitLabMergeRequestsSyncEndpoint>` выдаёт "
"пачки запросов на слияние."
msgstr ""
":ref:`gitlab-merge-requests-sync <GitLabMergeRequestsSyncEndpoint>` produces"
" batches of merge requests."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:14
msgid ""
"Потребители сохраняют состояние синхронизации. Обработку полученных объектов"
" и сохранение в целевые типы настраивает маршрут."
msgstr ""
"Consumers persist synchronization state. The route configures how received "
"objects are processed and saved to target types."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:17
msgid "Jira"
msgstr "Jira"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:19
msgid ""
"Настройте конечную точку ECOS для Jira и бин ``JiraApiClient``. В Citeck "
"должны существовать проекты с импортируемыми ключами и связанными рабочими "
"пространствами."
msgstr ""
"Configure an ECOS endpoint for Jira and a ``JiraApiClient`` bean. Projects "
"with the imported keys and associated workspaces must exist in Citeck."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:20
msgid ""
":ref:`jira-issues <JiraIssuesEndpoint>` читает задачи и задаёт контекст "
"проекта. Разделите пачку шагом ``split`` и сохраните исходную задачу в "
"переменной."
msgstr ""
":ref:`jira-issues <JiraIssuesEndpoint>` reads issues and sets the project "
"context. Split the batch using ``split`` and store the original issue in a "
"variable."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:21
msgid ""
":ref:`transform-jira-issue <TransformJiraIssueEndpoint>` преобразует задачу "
"по картам соответствия. Сохраните атрибуты через :ref:`ecos-records-mutate "
"<EcosRecordsMutateEndpoint>` и передайте ссылку на целевую задачу заголовком"
" ``eptIssueRef``."
msgstr ""
":ref:`transform-jira-issue <TransformJiraIssueEndpoint>` converts an issue "
"using mapping tables. Save the attributes through :ref:`ecos-records-mutate "
"<EcosRecordsMutateEndpoint>` and pass the target issue reference in the "
"``eptIssueRef`` header."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:22
msgid ""
"Восстанавливайте исходный JSON перед каждым импортом связанных объектов: "
":ref:`import-jira-releases <ImportJiraReleasesEndpoint>`, :ref:`import-jira-"
"attachment <ImportJiraAttachmentEndpoint>`, :ref:`import-jira-dev-info "
"<ImportJiraDevInfoEndpoint>`, :ref:`import-jira-component "
"<ImportJiraComponentEndpoint>`, :ref:`import-jira-sprint "
"<ImportJiraSprintEndpoint>`, :ref:`import-jira-tags "
"<ImportJiraTagsEndpoint>`."
msgstr ""
"Restore the original JSON before each import of related objects: "
":ref:`import-jira-releases <ImportJiraReleasesEndpoint>`, :ref:`import-jira-"
"attachment <ImportJiraAttachmentEndpoint>`, :ref:`import-jira-dev-info "
"<ImportJiraDevInfoEndpoint>`, :ref:`import-jira-component "
"<ImportJiraComponentEndpoint>`, :ref:`import-jira-sprint "
"<ImportJiraSprintEndpoint>`, :ref:`import-jira-tags "
"<ImportJiraTagsEndpoint>`."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:23
msgid ""
":ref:`transform-jira-comment <TransformJiraCommentEndpoint>` и "
":ref:`transform-jira-worklog <TransformJiraWorkLogEndpoint>` возвращают "
"атрибуты комментариев и трудозатрат; их также сохраняет маршрут. Заголовки "
"целевых записей — ``commentLinkToRecord`` и ``worklogLinkToRecord``."
msgstr ""
":ref:`transform-jira-comment <TransformJiraCommentEndpoint>` and "
":ref:`transform-jira-worklog <TransformJiraWorkLogEndpoint>` return comment "
"and worklog attributes; these are also saved by the route. Target record "
"headers are ``commentLinkToRecord`` and ``worklogLinkToRecord``."

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/external_import.rst:25
msgid ""
"Полный маршрут ``ecos-camel-examples/jira/yaml/jira-import.yml`` и другие "
"сценарии перечислены в :ref:`каталоге примеров <camel_dsl_repo_examples>`."
msgstr ""
"The complete ``ecos-camel-examples/jira/yaml/jira-import.yml`` route and "
"other scenarios are listed in the :ref:`example catalog "
"<camel_dsl_repo_examples>`."

